flowchart TD
    USER[Windows user] --> UI[React and Zustand projection]
    UI <-->|typed business methods| PRE[Sandboxed Preload]
    PRE <-->|validated IPC| MAIN[Electron Main and Host Process Manager]
    MAIN <-->|versioned JSONL| HOST[Local Agent Host]
    CLI[CLI] <-->|versioned JSONL| HOST
    HOST --> CONV[Conversation Service]
    HOST --> TASK[Task Engine]
    CONV -->|atomic message and task binding| SQL[(SQLite WAL)]
    TASK -->|TaskRun, Attempt, receipts and events| SQL
    HOST --> ORCH[Multi-Agent Orchestrator]
    ORCH --> ROOT[Root AgentRun]
    ROOT -->|bounded delegation| WORKER[Read-only Worker AgentRun]
    ORCH --> CONTEXT[Scoped Context Package]
    ROOT --> PI[Pi SDK]
    WORKER --> PI
    PI --> SESSION[(Pi JSONL sessions)]
    PI --> TOOLS[Capability and Workspace Tools]
    HOST --> VERIFY[Deterministic Verification]
    SQL -->|history and cursor events| CONV
    CONV -->|durable conversation stream| HOST
    SQL -.-> OBS[Read-only observation]
